ns is wondering if  there you have any ideas for soluble  organic fertilizers to use in drip  uh again no you're you're uh  you're asking the wrong person i really  i really don't i'm not aware  of what's available in terms of organic  fertilizers um  yeah certainly an interesting market but  i just don't have any experience in that  in that area  any other questions  thank you very much thank you all for  participating this week  and we'll have our third webinar  in the series next week  have a good afternoon thank you have a  good day  thank you  you
 

